# This app now talks to a local model served by Ollama (http://127.0.0.1:11434/v1)
# instead of the OpenAI cloud API, so no API key is required.
#
# Install Ollama (https://ollama.com), then pull the model used by the lessons:
#   ollama pull llama3.1:8b
# Make sure `ollama serve` is running before using the app.
